  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SION Women&apos;s Rice Value Addition Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice production and processing.Beneficiaries: ~300 women producers.Description: This project will enable SION to:.- Activity 1: Pre-finance the purchase of improved seeds, fertilizers and paddy rice from farmers.- Activity 2: Acquire and install a semi-industrial paddy rice processing line with logistical support to supply the factory and deliver product to market.- Activity 3: Improve the organization of women producers and parboilers of paddy to facilitate group purchases (Suppliers/Partners).- Activity 4: Recruit an accountant.- Activity 5: Training of employees on good paddy processing practices</narrative>
  </description>
